    "body": "Stopped because `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` failed twice on a pre-existing red check on `upstream/main`.\n\nWhat passed:\n- All 107 non-`xtask` steps passed twice in `gate quick`: `app` unit tests, all 105 `app` integration suites (including `example_catalog`, `cli`, and `scripting`), and `ui` `catalog_render`.\n- In `xtask` unit tests, 153 of 154 tests passed (including all four `catalog_tests`).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed with zero warnings.\n- `cargo xtask catalog --check` checked `2d/first-part`, and `cargo xtask catalog --screenshots` rendered `first-part.png` cleanly onto an orphan images branch without touching the working tree.\n\nWhat failed twice:\n- `gate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app` panicked with `suites without a Gate map: [\"tool_dxf_profile_mcp\"]` (tracked on `upstream/main` in #2411).\n\nHeld work is pushed on `mkinney:issue/2393-example-catalog-infra` (`Refs #2393`). After #2411 merges to `upstream/main`, merge `main` into `issue/2393-example-catalog-infra`, re-run `cargo xtask gate quick`, and open the PR. Removing `claimed`.\n",
